### Create a merchant
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchants
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_id": "merchant-1",
  "merchant_name": "Test Merchant"
}

### Create an authorization
# Returns 409 InsufficientFunds unless the caller's account has been credited
# by hand first (there's no deposit endpoint yet) — see README.md.
POST {{baseUrl}}/authorizations
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
idempotency-key: test-key-1

{
  "merchant_id": "merchant-1",
  "amount": 500
}
